  221: THE ENUMERATION is the four-axis product {latch clear, set} x {len 4, 8} x {read, write} x {the 7 labels the switch
  222: distinguishes: REV, CONTROL, INTSTAT, INTMASK, DOG, TIME, default} = 56 cells.
